Ringer
A 9-year-old girl was brought to your practice
two weeks ago with a fever. Your assessment
established an upper respiratory tract infection
(URTI) as the diagnosis; however, you were
also concerned about 3+ blood and 1+
proteinuria on a dipstick urine exam; therefore,
you advised a follow-up in two weeks. Today,
she is back for it, and dipstick urine shows 2+
blood and no proteinuria. You arrange for a
formal urinalysis that returns negative for
glomerular red blood cells and casts. Which one
of the following is the most important next step
in management?','{"A":"Urine culture.","B":"DMSA.","C":"Ultrasound.","D":"~—sCiIVP.","E":"ASOT."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 PAEDIATRIC (1).pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-bd643493c02e","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"6f8c9203419a79abf585","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 PAEDIATRIC (1).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 PAEDIATRIC (1).pdf","source_page":128,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"five_block_inferred","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','medium','{"record_id":"6f8c9203419a79abf585","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 PAEDIATRIC (1).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 PAEDIATRIC (1).pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":128,"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Paediatrics","stem":"| *.\nRinger\nA 9-year-old girl was brought to your practice\ntwo weeks ago with a fever. Your assessment\nestablished an upper respiratory tract infection\n(URTI) as the diagnosis; however, you were\nalso concerned about 3+ blood and 1+\nproteinuria on a dipstick urine exam; therefore,\nyou advised a follow-up in two weeks. Today,\nshe is back for it, and dipstick urine shows 2+\nblood and no proteinuria. You arrange for a\nformal urinalysis that returns negative for\nglomerular red blood cells and casts. Which one\nof the following is the most important next step\nin management?","options":{"A":"Urine culture.","B":"DMSA.","C":"Ultrasound.","D":"~—sCiIVP.","E":"ASOT."},"source_answer":null,"source_explanation":null,"source_answer_status":"pending_import","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"medium","currentness_keywords":["age","management"],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"medium","par