Jesse, because of bedwetting. Jesse is her first
child and is the outcome of an uncomplicated
pregnancy with good health so far. He mingles
with his peers and has met all milestones
otherwise. He Is very attached to his Teddy bear
and will not sleep without it. He also has some
imaginary friends with whom he talks
sometimes. He is dry during the daytime but
wets the bed a few times per month. Physical
