measles and wants to know if the child needs
to be excluded from school. The diagnosis
was made when the typical rash developed 6
days ago and he has not attended his class
Since then. The teacher has informed her that
all children in the class has been immunized
against measles. Which one of the following
would be the most appropriate advice?','{"A":"No more exclusion is required.","B":"He should be excluded from school\nfor a total period of 14 days after\nthe rash.","C":"Ole He should be excluded for another\n4 days.","D":"He shoudl receive MMR vaccine\nbefore he can go back to school.","E":"CE He can go to school when the rash\ncompletely resolves."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 PAEDIATRIC (3).pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-67fd53792a8f","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"fdaf6ee85e1c71142954","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 PAEDIATRIC (3).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 PAEDIATRIC (3).pdf","source_page":97,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"c6e5e315cc29e693a644","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Pediatric amedex 2025.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Pediatric amedex 2025.pdf","source_page":9,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"9cedc45b05784a63c752","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":1284,"source_qid":"709"}],"parser_version":"2.8.2-residual-resolver-page-checkpoint-local-render-2026-09-23","parser_mode":"v28_selective_ocr_base_parser","text_method":"v28_selective_ocr","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,'text',NULL,'needs_verification','[]','medium','{"record_id":"fdaf6ee85e1c71142954","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 PAEDIATRIC (3).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 PAEDIATRIC (3).pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":97,"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Paediatrics","stem":"A mother brings her 7-year-old son who has\nmeasles and wants to know if the child needs\nto be excluded from school. The diagnosis\nwas made when the typical rash developed 6\ndays ago and he has not attended his class\nSince then. The teacher has informed her that\nall children in the class has